  "details": "When a world loads into VRChat that contains portals to other worlds, a person can run inside, and it will set as a Public instance.\nFor the security update, could there be a way to set a personal preference of what type of instance that should be loaded behind the leader when they go first into the portal?\nFor example, I'll load into The Great Pug, and go to the Winchester portal that's by the spawn. I would like the preference of the portal to be designated to Friends only, locked; versus the default public unlocked.",
